38437>>>                Case Break
38438>>>
38438>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38438>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38438>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
38438>>>                Send ShowInfoBox "Esto es una navegación indefinida"
38439>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38440>>>
38440>>>        Case End
38440>>>
38440>>>    End_Procedure
